# Terraform — local state and secrets stay out of git (recurses into all subdirs).
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json

# Keep provider lock files committed.
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl
